  title "The Obelisk at Momiou"
  summary "A squad of Midnight Claws—Silvtasaevus~, Nanaiamis~, ☽'umbraum, Velumia~, and Augur ☽'Milucaum~—defend a terrace while guarding a dangerous artifact called the Obelisk against attacking orcas led by Gnarkzund Zaith and Thung Thrakrek As the terrace crumbles under assault, ☽'umbraum is killed in a collapse, and the squad realizes they must perform a forbidden blood-working spell using the Obelisk and their own bonds to survive. Augur and Nanaiamis~ sacrifice themselves to cast the spell, which decompresses the terrace and kills Gnarkzund Zaith and Thung Thrakrek along with their packmates, leaving Velumia~ as the sole survivor to carry the weight of their violation of the Pactum∴ne accord."
